#: patterns/self-hosting.php
msgctxt "Pattern title"
msgid "Portal or self-hosted"
msgstr "Portal oder selbst betreiben"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php
msgctxt "Pattern description"
msgid "The two ways to use the app as cards, followed by the home network installation with Docker Compose."
msgstr "Die zwei Wege zur App als Karten, darunter die Installation im Heimnetz per Docker Compose."

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:17
msgid "Two ways"
msgstr "Zwei Wege"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:21
msgid "In the portal or self-hosted"
msgstr "Im Portal oder selbst betrieben"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:25
msgid "Same app, same features – you decide where your data lives."
msgstr "Dieselbe App, dieselben Funktionen – du entscheidest, wo deine Daten liegen."

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:39
msgid "In the portal"
msgstr "Im Portal"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:43
msgid "Sign up and get started – no server of your own. Everyone has their own account."
msgstr "Registrieren und loslegen – ohne eigenen Server. Jede Person hat ihr eigenes Konto."

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:49
msgid "No installation needed"
msgstr "Keine Installation nötig"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:53
msgid "Available on the go"
msgstr "Erreichbar von unterwegs"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:57
msgid "Account with email address and password"
msgstr "Konto mit E-Mail-Adresse und Passwort"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:79
msgid "Self-hosted"
msgstr "Selbst betrieben"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:83
msgid "Household mode runs in your home network – on a PC, a server or a Raspberry Pi. Everyone picks their profile, no password needed."
msgstr "Der Haushaltsmodus läuft in deinem Heimnetz – auf PC, Server oder Raspberry Pi. Jede Person wählt ihr Profil, ganz ohne Passwort."

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:89
msgid "Free and open source"
msgstr "Kostenlos und quelloffen"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:93
msgid "Docker images for amd64 and arm64"
msgstr "Docker-Images für amd64 und arm64"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:97
msgid "Your data stays with you"
msgstr "Deine Daten bleiben bei dir"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:105
msgid "Guide on GitHub"
msgstr "Anleitung auf GitHub"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:115
msgid "In your home network in four steps – on any computer with Docker:"
msgstr "Im Heimnetz in vier Schritten – auf jedem Rechner mit Docker:"

#: patterns/self-hosting.php:122
msgid "set a password for BM_DB_PASSWORD in .env first"
msgstr "vorher in .env ein Passwort für BM_DB_PASSWORD setzen"

